{"articles":[{"no":"第一點","path":[],"text":"嘉義縣政府（以下簡稱本府）為審慎處理違反建築法（以下簡稱本法\n\n\n    ）使用管理規定事件，並兼顧裁罰之明確性、適當性與公平性及符合\n\n\n    比例原則，以減少裁罰爭議及提升行政效率，特訂定本基準。","id":"嘉義縣-GL000501/a:1","anchor":"a-1","contentHash":"6e9dbc47f7d3b6010c762900b4b1900e3735fc47e91151adf2682bf1b3845598","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第二點","path":[],"text":"本基準有關建築物之用途分類，依建築物使用類組及變更使用辦法之\n\n\n    類組定義、使用項目舉例等規定辦理。","id":"嘉義縣-GL000501/a:2","anchor":"a-2","contentHash":"6cfcd06da02581879a2c36899cf9b889c2204c8fe7bed612ffb279a22f4aaa1c","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第三點","path":[],"text":"違反本法使用管理規定事件裁罰基準如附表。","id":"嘉義縣-GL000501/a:3","anchor":"a-3","contentHash":"5ff43798ce9de41584bc23fda7777bee97f486eb9ff7f4ade86d66b505273fb4","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第四點","path":[],"text":"違反本基準附表所列違規事件，如有特殊情況者，得審酌違反行政法\n\n\n    上義務行為應受責難程度、所生影響、所得利益及受處罰者之資力，\n\n\n    依本基準附表酌予加重或減輕其處罰及延長或縮短改善期限，並均應\n\n\n    敘明理由。","id":"嘉義縣-GL000501/a:4","anchor":"a-4","contentHash":"b819d16ef0477c2160b50f09a4e58f30df451002aa67b91bc1c0434d248a2d22","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}}],"attachments":[{"title":"附表.pdf","url":"https://law.cyhg.gov.tw/Download.ashx?FileID=292003&id=GL000501&type=LAW"},{"title":"附表.odt","url":"https://law.cyhg.gov.tw/Download.ashx?FileID=292004&id=GL000501&type=LAW"}],"category":"使用與室內裝修","coverage":"full","effective":"","effectiveNote":"","history":"","id":"嘉義縣-GL000501","keywords":[],"kind":"地方規定","modified":"民國 113 年 10 月 23 日","name":"嘉義縣政府處理違反建築法使用管理規定事件裁罰基準","region":"嘉義縣","source":"嘉義縣法規查詢系統","status":"來源現行頁","url":"https://law.cyhg.gov.tw/LawContent.aspx?id=GL000501","retrieved":"2026-09-29T00:34:28+00:00","snapshot":"","schemaVersion":2,"contentHash":"13a7c422dbf4ace49f241e4dd3f2527c001096d71262e00b8bee9905f97250aa","sourceRecordId":"嘉義縣-GL000501","version":{"observedAt":"2026-09-29T00:39:28+00:00","previousContentHash":null,"officialModified":"民國 113 年 10 月 23 日","effectiveDate":""}}